# Keep Dropbox out of the generated native build.
#
# These are regenerated per machine by `npx cap add ios` / `add android` and by
# npm, and every one of them is already in .gitignore. Dropbox syncing them is
# pure cost: ios/Pods alone is thousands of files, and this repo has a history of
# Dropbox evicting or conflict-renaming heavy generated folders mid-write. An
# earlier attempt at this session marked ios/ ignored by xattr AFTER it had been
# populated, and Dropbox purged the local copy into an "ios 2" conflict folder.
#
# Declaring it here instead means the rule exists BEFORE the folder does, which
# is the only ordering that works.
ios
android
node_modules
